design/08-art-direction.md:20:| Gold | cash-out, jackpots, payout moments |
design/08-art-direction.md:21:| Dim cyan/white | chrome, clocks, filler ticker text |
design/08-art-direction.md-22-
design/08-art-direction.md:23:Rule: green/red never used for anything but money-good/money-bad — the gambling color language stays pure.
design/08-art-direction.md-24-
design/08-art-direction.md-25-## The room (Allen's spec — scope-locked)
design/08-art-direction.md-26-
--
design/08-art-direction.md-30-- **Window beside** — time-of-day/mood light (state-driven)
design/08-art-direction.md-31-- **Small desk table with laptop** — the book: ticket building, shop, run info
design/08-art-direction.md-32-- **Mini fridge** — flavor interaction (state-driven contents: heater = stocked, buried = empty)
design/08-art-direction.md:33:- **Phone** — bookie notifications, debt messages, cash-out buzz (audible anywhere in the room)
design/08-art-direction.md-34-
design/08-art-direction.md-35-### Room state = the health bar (~4 variants)
design/08-art-direction.md-36-
--
design/08-art-direction.md-38-|---|---|---|
design/08-art-direction.md-39-| 1. Baseline | run start | dingy but okay; neutral light |
design/08-art-direction.md-40-| 2. Heater | win streak / bank ≫ target | new couch, a plant, sunlight through the blinds |
design/08-art-direction.md:41:| 3. Sweating | debt > 0 | darker, bills on the desk, red notification glow |
design/08-art-direction.md-42-| 4. Buried | deep debt / near-death | boarded window, unpaid bills pile, room lit only by the TV |
design/08-art-direction.md-43-
design/08-art-direction.md:44:Production plan (scope guard): the Phase 2 vertical slice ships with **state 1 only, plus a lighting/prop-decal layer** that fakes states 3–4 (red wash, bill decals, darker exposure). Full four-variant art lands after the slice's gate. Room art sourcing: asset-kit bash + AI-gen concept passes, cleanup by hand; if the slice validates, commission a proper environment pass.
design/08-art-direction.md-45-
design/08-art-direction.md-46-## Juice mapping (design/06 effects re-expressed in this style)
design/08-art-direction.md-47-
design/08-art-direction.md:48:- Leg GREEN: TV flash + phosphor bloom + scanline jump; DEAD: TV cuts to static for a beat, room darkens one notch
design/08-art-direction.md:49:- Cash-out taken: gold sweep across the TV, register *ka-chunk*, phone buzz
design/08-art-direction.md:50:- Bookie float: the room dims, red notification glow, phone rattles on the desk
design/08-art-direction.md-51-- Big payout: neon spill from the TV lights the whole room — the room is the reaction shot
design/08-art-direction.md-52-- Progressive sweat density (design/04): early rounds = calm TV, simple scorebug; late rounds = picture-in-picture wall, ticker crawl, notification spam
design/08-art-direction.md-53-
design/08-art-direction.md-54-## Capsule / marketing note
design/08-art-direction.md-55-
design/08-art-direction.md:56:The money shot is the room at night, face-lit... except there's no face — the empty couch, the glowing TV showing 61%, the gold CASH OUT prompt. Distinctive against both real-app screenshots and pixel-art competitors; reads at capsule size because it's one light source and three colors.
design/08-art-direction.md-57-
design/08-art-direction.md:58:## Deferred
design/08-art-direction.md-59-
design/08-art-direction.md-60-- Game name: SBR codename until Phase 3 (decided 2026-07-10).
design/08-art-direction.md-61-- Character visibility (hands? reflection in the TV during static?): mood garnish, decide during the slice.

